GPL version 2 or later.

marionnet-launcher.png is the single source of the standard application icon.
Replace this file to update the main window, dialogs and desktop launcher.
The legacy ../marionnet-launcher.png path is a relative symbolic link to it.
Dune installs the desktop theme icon and pixmaps fallback from this same source.
marionnet-exam-launcher.png is the deliberately separate exam-mode variant.
